{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.QBeta.QPochhammerPoles","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.QBeta.QPochhammerPoles","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Field.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":5,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.qPochDenom_poles","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.qPochDenom_poles","kind":"theorem","line":54,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/QPochhammerPoles.lean#L54-L62","doc":"The pole set `{q^{-k} : k < n}` is contained in the zero set of `(x;q)_n`;\nstated as the roots exist as the explicit function `k ↦ q^{-k}` **and**\neach is a genuine root (the content the bare `∃ z, z k = q^{-k}` field of\nthe conjecture class omits). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.qPochDenom_eq_zero_at_pole","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.qPochDenom_eq_zero_at_pole","kind":"theorem","line":39,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/QPochhammerPoles.lean#L39-L52","doc":"**The pole vanishing.** `(x; q)_n` vanishes at each pole `x = q^{-j}`,\n`j < n` — the algebraic, unconditional half of the pole-to-cusp bijection\n(`conj:algebraic-geometric-dilog-equivalence §1`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.qPochDenom_succ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.qPochDenom_succ","kind":"theorem","line":36,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/QPochhammerPoles.lean#L36-L37","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.qPochDenom_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.qPochDenom_zero","kind":"theorem","line":33,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/QPochhammerPoles.lean#L33-L34","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.qPochDenom","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.qPochDenom","kind":"def","line":28,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/QPochhammerPoles.lean#L28-L31","doc":"q-Pochhammer partial denominator `(x; q)_n = ∏_{k=0}^{n-1}(1 − x qᵏ)`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}